sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant CLI as oc / kubectl CLI
    participant Pod as must-gather Pod<br/>(gather.sh)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>/must-gather/

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Admin,FS: Flow 1: OpenShift Full Collection
        Admin->>CLI: oc adm must-gather --image=...
        CLI->>Pod: Create must-gather pod<br/>TLS 1.2+ / kubeconfig
        Pod->>K8sAPI: GET infrastructures.config.openshift.io<br/>ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>Pod: Detect OCP distribution

        par 14 Component Collectors in Parallel
            Pod->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect (KServe namespace)<br/>ServiceAccount token
            Pod->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect (LLM-D namespace)<br/>ServiceAccount token
            Pod->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect (DSP namespace)<br/>ServiceAccount token
            Pod->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect (other namespaces...)<br/>ServiceAccount token
        end

        Pod->>K8sAPI: helm get values/manifest<br/>ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>Pod: Helm release data
        Pod->>FS: Write collected data
        CLI->>Admin: rsync collected data<br/>TLS 1.2+ / kubeconfig
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Admin,FS: Flow 2: xKS Collection (Job-based)
        Admin->>CLI: kubectl apply -f must-gather-job.yaml
        CLI->>Pod: Create must-gather Job<br/>TLS 1.2+ / kubeconfig
        Pod->>K8sAPI: detect_k8s_distro<br/>(node metadata heuristics)
        K8sAPI-->>Pod: Detect AKS/EKS/CKS

        Pod->>K8sAPI: kubectl api-resources<br/>(auto-discover all types)
        K8sAPI-->>Pod: Resource type list

        par Per-namespace collection
            Pod->>K8sAPI: kubectl get (each resource type)<br/>ServiceAccount token
            Pod->>K8sAPI: kubectl logs (per container, parallel)<br/>ServiceAccount token
        end

        Pod->>FS: Write to /tmp/must-gather/
        Admin->>CLI: kubectl cp (retrieve data)<br/>TLS 1.2+ / kubeconfig
    end
